      "id": "t45_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -284
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "MIDI CC → parameter\n\n`input/midi-cc` reads one Control Change knob from a connected MIDI device. The output is already mapped to [0, 1] via `value`; `raw` gives the original 0–127.\n\nPlug in a controller, pick the device + CC number; rotate the knob to scale the rectangle.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "MIDI CC → parameter\n\n`input/midi-cc` reads one Control Change knob from a connected MIDI device. The output is already mapped to [0, 1] via `value`; `raw` gives the original 0–127.\n\nPlug in a controller, pick the device + CC number; rotate the knob to scale the rectangle.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 220
      }
    },
